      "slot": "inverses",
      "skill": "knowledge",
      "variant": "A",
      "q": "Determine the inverse of f(x) = 2x − 6.",
      "qAf": "Bepaal die omgekeerde van f(x) = 2x − 6.",
      "options": [
        "(x + 6)/2",
        "2x + 6",
        "(x − 6)/2",
        "x/2 + 6"
      ],
      "optionsAf": [
        "(x + 6)/2",
        "2x + 6",
        "(x − 6)/2",
        "x/2 + 6"
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "explain": "Let y = 2x − 6, then x = (y + 6)/2, so f⁻¹(x) = (x + 6)/2.",
      "explainAf": "Laat y = 2x − 6, dan is x = (y + 6)/2, dus f⁻¹(x) = (x + 6)/2."
    },
    {
      "id": "mm12-functions-logarithms-inverses-b",
      "slot": "inverses",
      "skill": "application",
      "variant": "B",
      "q": "f(x) = x² − 4 for x ≥ 0. Determine f⁻¹(x).",
      "qAf": "f(x) = x² − 4 vir x ≥ 0. Bepaal f⁻¹(x).",
      "options": [
        "√(x + 4)",
        "−√(x + 4)",
        "x² + 4",
        "√(x − 4)"
      ],
      "optionsAf": [
        "√(x + 4)",
        "−√(x + 4)",
        "x² + 4",
        "√(x − 4)"
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "explain": "Swap x and y: x = y² − 4, so y = ±√(x + 4). Since f has domain x ≥ 0, its range is y ≥ −4 and the inverse only takes non-negative values, so y = √(x + 4).",
      "explainAf": "Verwissel x en y: x = y² − 4, dus y = ±√(x + 4). Omdat f domein x ≥ 0 het, is die waardeversameling y ≥ −4 en die omgekeerde neem net nie-negatiewe waardes aan, dus y = √(x + 4)."
    },
